# The CSV template is the one source build.js embeds verbatim (base64), without
# the CRLF -> LF normalisation readText() applies to every other file. Its bytes
# on disk therefore land in "Statement Studio.html" as-is, so the checkout has to
# be identical on every machine or the bundle is not reproducible.
#
# CRLF is deliberate: the user downloads this template and opens it in Excel on
# Windows. Stored LF in the repository, checked out CRLF everywhere.
*.csv text eol=crlf
